# Fast city test v2 (testspeed, 2026-11-08): boot the first save (auto-loaded, no menu), the city intro movie is
# the 4 s placeholder, then WAIT (no presses: X does not skip the Kuo cutscene and a late X makes Cole jump) for
# the gameplay HUD = anchor. Measured where Sami's session sat at ~52 fps: minutes 27-28 of
# play\20261108-125910 are the first gameplay minutes on this dock, right after the same cutscene.
#   0-16 s   stand still: the dock + street view (the heavy one; RSX + PPU main bound)
#   16-46 s  walk forward (left stick) from that view, into the street
#   47-55 s  camera pan right (right stick) where the walk ends
# Run: tools\fast.ps1 -Tag X -Steps tools\fast_city2.steps
#! seconds 220
#! anchor_range 55:100
#! savefrom work\saves\first-save\gamedata
#! windows 2:16,20:46,48:55
#! pad w16:0x10000:30,w47:0x800000:8
wait v_02_city_intro 120
sleep 2
waitimg city_hud 40,20,340,130 15 120
sleep 2
anchor
at 8
shot a8
at 20
shot a20
at 26
shot a26
at 32
shot a32
at 38
shot a38
at 44
shot a44
at 50
shot a50
at 54
shot a54
at 56
close
